  {
    "id": 6003001090010,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "プロデューサー！！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "characters",
    "charId": "003",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "bg": "00002",
    "se": "0107",
    "voice": "produce_events/600300109/6003001090010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "わっ、め、めぐる……！？\r\nっと……",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6003001090020,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "プロデューサー、わたしやったよ！\r\n優勝できたんだよ！！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600300109/6003001090020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、しっかり見てたよ",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "でも急に飛びついてくるなよ、危ないだろ\r\n嬉しいのは分かるけど、ちょっと落ち着いてくれ",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6003001090030,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "だってだって、優勝したんだよ！？\r\nまだまだ喜び足りないもん、落ち着いてられないよ！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "se": "0107",
    "voice": "produce_events/600300109/6003001090030"
  },
  {
    "id": 6003001090040,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "あっ！　そうだ！\r\n友達にも電話しなきゃ！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600300109/6003001090040"
  },
  {
    "id": 6003001090050,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "あー、でも、誰から電話しよう！？\r\nみんないっぱい応援してくれてたし……！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600300109/6003001090050"
  },
  {
    "id": 6003001090060,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "やっぱり直接家まで行った方がいいのかな！？\r\nそっちの方が、感謝の気持ち、伝わるよね！",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600300109/6003001090060"
  },
  {
    "id": 6003001090070,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "あぁ、だけど人数が多いから……えっと、え～っと！\r\nわたしが分身できればいいんだけどな……！",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600300109/6003001090070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "めぐる、いいから落ち着け\r\nまずは深呼吸だ",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6003001090080,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "う、うん\r\nすぅ～、はぁ～……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600300109/6003001090080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……落ち着いたか？",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6003001090090,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "う、うん、ちょっとだけ……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600300109/6003001090090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なら俺からも改めてお祝いを言わせてくれ\r\n『W.I.N.G.』優勝おめでとう。よくやったな",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6003001090100,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "プロデューサー……\r\nありがとう……！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600300109/6003001090100"
  },
  {
    "id": 6003001090110,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "でもね……わたしが優勝できたのは\r\n応援してくれるみんなや……",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600300109/6003001090110"
  },
  {
    "id": 6003001090120,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "プロデューサーがいてくれたからだよ！",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600300109/6003001090120"
  },
  {
    "id": 6003001090130,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "友達に言われて、なんとなくで始めた\r\nアイドルだったけど……",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600300109/6003001090130"
  },
  {
    "id": 6003001090140,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "こんなに楽しく、真剣に頑張ってこれたのは\r\n全部プロデューサーのおかげなんだ！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600300109/6003001090140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そんなことないさ\r\nめぐるの才能と頑張りがあってこその結果だよ",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "誰よりも努力してきたのは\r\n他でもない、めぐる自身なんだからさ",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6003001090150,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "えへへー！\r\nプロデューサーがそう言ってくれると嬉しいな！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600300109/6003001090150"
  },
  {
    "id": 6003001090160,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "……わたしが友達とアイドルどっちを選ぶか迷った時、\r\nプロデューサー、ちゃんと話を聞いてくれたよね？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600300109/6003001090160"
  },
  {
    "id": 6003001090170,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "無理だって、諦めろっていう方が絶対簡単だったのに\r\nそんなことしないで、一緒に考えてくれて……",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600300109/6003001090170"
  },
  {
    "id": 6003001090180,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "そのおかげで、友達もアイドルも、\r\n大事なものを全部諦めないでここまで来れたんだ！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600300109/6003001090180"
  },
  {
    "id": 6003001090190,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "そうやって進む道があるなんて、\r\nわたし一人じゃ、きっと思いつかなかった",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600300109/6003001090190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "めぐる……",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6003001090200,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "だから……だからね",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600300109/6003001090200"
  },
  {
    "id": 6003001090210,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "プロデューサー、\r\nわたしのそばにいてくれてありがとう！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "se": "0107",
    "voice": "produce_events/600300109/6003001090210"
  },
  {
    "id": 6003001090220,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "プロデューサーのこと、大好きだよ！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600300109/6003001090220"
  },
  {
    "label": "end"
  }
]